# Release notes
The 0.6 release ships streaming markdown with inline code and
legacy paths removed.

## Highlights
- table renderer matches the dialog one
- syntax highlighting in fenced code
- bug fix: trailing newline in headings

> Heads up: the API changed in one place — see below.

